      },
      "html": "<style data-kid=\"0\">\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n  \n  .animate-fade-in {\n    animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out forwards;\n  }\n  \n  @keyframes fadeIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n  }\n\n  .glow-mesh {\n    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, rgba(184, 115, 92, 0.15), transparent 70%);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" data-kid=\"1\">\n\n<section class=\"relative pt-32 pb-20 overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center min-h-[1100px] bg-black font-sans selection:bg-[#FAE6E1]/30 selection:text-white glow-mesh\" data-kid=\"2\">\n  \n  <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-4xl h-[500px] bg-[#B8735C]/5 blur-[120px] -z-10 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"3\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-4xl px-6 z-10 w-full animate-fade-in\" data-kid=\"4\">\n    \n    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-[#B8735C]/20 bg-[#B8735C]/5 mb-10 group cursor-default transition-colors hover:border-[#B8735C]/40\" data-kid=\"5\">\n      <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"6\">\n        <i class=\"ti ti-bolt text-[#B8735C] text-sm relative z-10\" data-kid=\"7\"></i>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#B8735C] blur-md opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"8\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[#FAE6E1] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase\" data-kid=\"9\">\n        THE DUBSADO THAT TAKES 30 MINUTES TO SET UP, NOT 2 WEEKS\n      </span>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <h1 class=\"text-[56px] md:text-[72px] text-white mb-8 leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] font-medium\" data-kid=\"10\">\n      Stop losing hours to client <br class=\"hidden md:block\" data-kid=\"11\">\n      <span class=\"italic text-[#FAE6E1] relative\" data-kid=\"12\">\n        onboarding chaos.\n        <svg class=\"absolute -bottom-2 left-0 w-full h-2 text-[#B8735C]/30\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 10\" fill=\"none\" data-kid=\"13\">\n          <path d=\"M0 5C20 1 80 9 100 5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-kid=\"14\"></path>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n    </h1>\n\n    \n    <p class=\"text-[18px] text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-2xl mb-12 leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"15\">\n      Send one link. Your client signs the contract, pays the deposit, and submits their brief — without creating an account. Setup takes 30 minutes, not two weeks.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"p-1 rounded-full bg-[#1A1A1A]/40 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] flex items-center mb-24 transition-all hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-[#1A1A1A]/60\" data-kid=\"16\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#FAE6E1] text-black text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-[#F5D8D0] transition-all transform hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] shadow-lg shadow-[#FAE6E1]/10\" data-kid=\"17\">\n        Claim my spot\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-8 py-3.5 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:text-[#FAE6E1] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 group\" data-kid=\"18\">\n        See how it works \n        <span class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-y-1\" data-kid=\"19\">↓</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl rounded-t-[24px] border-t border-x border-white/10 overflow-hidden shadow-[0_-30px_60px_-15px_rgba(184,115,92,0.1)] group\" data-kid=\"20\">\n      \n      <div class=\"absolute top-0 inset-x-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"21\"></div>\n      \n      <img src=\"/api/local/images/public/hero.png\" alt=\"Platform Interface\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"22\">\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-64 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/90 to-transparent pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"23\"></div>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3/4 h-24 bg-[#B8735C]/10 blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"24\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
